 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "What if Earth spun faster, and couldn't stop?",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 2.807,
   "sha256": "18f4c3cecb84568121fb9e8d5b079c3f9decbf1cc6d8075d763ca3b51470410e"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "hook-1",
   "text": "You are standing on the equator, and you are going to watch what happens, minute by minute, until the planet can't take it anymore.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 9.575,
   "sha256": "3a44d32beda2e06d67cd0c2e9f22c2f84c02c2ceae762bf0066c17b079129fec"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "premise-1",
   "text": "The Earth keeps its size, its shape, its air and its water.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 4.105,
   "sha256": "ed2fc02ab65ab98df6ba8b337490f0941dbe345a5e78342e26c939997df66242"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "premise-2",
   "text": "Only the spin changes, and it only ever gets faster.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 4.35,
   "sha256": "9024b9253a8d2b1b5c8107bd45e943a127e85d5d76cea87e97250563e2311bc5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "premise-3",
   "text": "On screen there is one number that matters: the length of a day.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 4.644,
   "sha256": "806a5ab8def9ee84f6dd5dceae1ca6d3f1fbb793b6bf6e55bb34cae6010b2a90"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "premise-4",
   "text": "It starts at twenty-four hours, and by the end it will have fallen to about an hour and twenty-four minutes.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 7.544,
   "sha256": "79ab6d267fdb3a639fef097fa8a071ba3130ffbdd500881fce46c8fbf76503e0"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "today-1",
   "text": "Right now, one day lasts twenty-four hours.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 2.949,
   "sha256": "ec263b8f167986e52d711f9ff8a7c486788178350716689872ab6f270daf72c7"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "today-2",
   "text": "Standing on the equator, the ground carries you around at about sixteen hundred and seventy kilometers an hour.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 8.67,
   "sha256": "6eab5f46a0335b245756732f4ecd8848297ca4d4cd55e5acaa5562926e9a8933"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "today-3",
   "text": "What you do feel is a tiny push outward.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 3.121,
   "sha256": "f2860dd5e2c0f483389ac46b52110de4c552f6571a170ddd2a2857972752fd6b"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Hang on. If you're enjoying this, tap like and follow. Okay, back to the math.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 6.197,
   "sha256": "1af20f4a97abdf86d2c8963174790231e18f3926e533514b83026de24df0b573"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "today-4",
   "text": "You weigh about a third of a percent less than you would on a planet that did not spin.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 5.809,
   "sha256": "9d040ede02e40309869c949b3a982c5670ee820daf64e35133fdf04abd7fec97"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And the spin has only just begun to speed up.",
